<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:41:57 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>黄仁勋重新出任英伟达首席执行官，台积电一天内市值就增加了 1580 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/tsmc-gains-158-billion-in-value-in-one-day-as-jensen-huang-returns-as-nvidia-ceo/</link><description>此次反弹收复了台北股市 17.5% 的周跌幅，这是自 1991 年以来最严重的跌幅，当时监管机构曾被迫遏制卖空行为。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2260737267-e1795503471942.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:05:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/tsmc-gains-158-billion-in-value-in-one-day-as-jensen-huang-returns-as-nvidia-ceo/</guid></item><item><title>抛售、美国总统上台或经济衰退：到底是什么让英伟达让黄仁勋重新担任首席执行官？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/why-did-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-market-selloff-government-intervention-recession-worries/</link><description>As investors and Huang fans celebrated, broader questions loomed over Monday&amp;#39;s stunning sequence of events. &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2277921666-e1795471738230.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:44:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/why-did-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-market-selloff-government-intervention-recession-worries/</guid></item><item><title>随着联邦紧急事务管理署 (FEMA) 将恢复工作推向各州，一家迈阿密初创公司为灾难幸存者推出人工智能案例管理器</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/aidfinder-ai-disaster-recovery-palisades-fire-nostrant/</link><description>总部位于迈阿密的 AidFinder 使用人工智能为幸存者匹配援助计划并准备他们的申请。随着联邦紧急事务管理署 (FEMA) 敦促各州承担更多的复苏任务，它的宣传落地。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/founderof-aidfinder-startup.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/aidfinder-ai-disaster-recovery-palisades-fire-nostrant/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普向英伟达董事会就国家安全做出的“保证”：免受法律危险的主要来源的影响？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/trump-assurance-to-nvidia-board-over-national-security-legal-threats/</link><description>A White House spokesperson confirmed Trump&amp;#39;s role to Fortune: “President Trump was totally involved … We have to protect our geniuses.” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297774940_c2183f-e1795467728359.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:25:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/trump-assurance-to-nvidia-board-over-national-security-legal-threats/</guid></item><item><title>黄仁勋重返 Nvidia 的 11 天</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/the-11-days-that-brought-jensen-huang-back-to-nvidia/</link><description>英伟达周一宣布，董事会恢复黄仁勋担任首席执行官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299110515-e1795464871850.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:07:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/the-11-days-that-brought-jensen-huang-back-to-nvidia/</guid></item><item><title>黄仁勋的回归是硅谷想要的——但情况不一定会一样</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/jensen-huangs-return-is-what-silicon-valley-wanted-but-things-wont-necessarily-be-the-same/</link><description>黄仁勋与一名涉嫌中国间谍的恋情导致他被英伟达开除。十一天后，他回来了——这是硅谷创始人、观察家和名人一直想要的结果。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2298610171-e1795473056383.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:31:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/jensen-huangs-return-is-what-silicon-valley-wanted-but-things-wont-necessarily-be-the-same/</guid></item><item><title>由于首次公开募股，Anthropic 的百万富翁数量现在比整个洛杉矶还要多——员工一夜之间总共赚了 4,300 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-centimillionaires-more-than-major-cities-or-third-of-us-households-wealth-distribution-warnings-billionaire-ceo-dario-amodei/</link><description>Anthropic 轰动一时的 IPO 创造的净资产达 1 亿美元的人数比居住在整个伦敦、巴黎或洛杉矶的人数还多。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305353984-e1795451362557.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:20:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-centimillionaires-more-than-major-cities-or-third-of-us-households-wealth-distribution-warnings-billionaire-ceo-dario-amodei/</guid></item><item><title>“超级智能即将到来”：马克·扎克伯格的人工智能负责人警告说，随着人工智能泡沫拒绝破裂，人类可能会失去控制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/alexandr-wang-meta-superintelligence-arriving-riemann-hypothesis-nasdaq-ai-selloff/</link><description>Meta 的人工智能负责人表示，与黎曼假设相比，原子弹是“一个家庭作业问题”，一位人择数学家说他与克劳德一起破解了黎曼假设。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2296214013.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:35:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/alexandr-wang-meta-superintelligence-arriving-riemann-hypothesis-nasdaq-ai-selloff/</guid></item><item><title>“没有回答重大问题”：尽管周一股市上涨，但股市仍比人工智能推动的峰值低 5 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/wall-street-ai-stock-market-selloff-8-trillion-loss-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-anthropic-ipo-memory-chips-rebound/</link><description>华尔街自 2025 年 4 月以来最好的一天——以及黄仁勋的复活——仍然让人工智能交易陷入困境。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2301014104_491794-e1795469835258.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:44:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/wall-street-ai-stock-market-selloff-8-trillion-loss-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-anthropic-ipo-memory-chips-rebound/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能初创公司担心，如果没有黄仁勋，英伟达的资金就会枯竭。他重新担任首席执行官消除了这些担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-jensen-huang-return-ai-startups-neoclouds-funding/</link><description>近两周来，投资者担心英伟达的投资和信贷支持可能会在临时首席执行官的领导下陷入停滞。黄的回归平息了这些担忧。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299100584-e1794504561328.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:21:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-jensen-huang-return-ai-startups-neoclouds-funding/</guid></item></channel></rss>